{"id": "1585", "type": "page", "slug": "oasis-therapy-center", "path": "the-campus-facilities/oasis-therapy-center", "title": "Oasis Therapy Center", "date": "2025-04-15 09:54:57", "modified": "2026-08-25 18:04:59", "excerpt": "", "content": "<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spa_logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"231\" />\r\n\r\nWhole Body Therapies &amp; Treatments to Support Optimal Wellbeing\r\n\r\nTripadvisor rating:\r\n\r\n<img title=\"\" src=\"/images/tripadvisor.svg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/card_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"268\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>\r\nAll organic lotions, oils, scrubs, and wraps</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nLocated on a 55-acre tropical wellness retreat</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nState-of-the-art energy healing services &amp; Treatments for the mind, body &amp; Spirit</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nPsychotherapy, wellness coaching, mandala breathwork &amp; S.H.I.F.T (State of the Heart Integrative Feeling Therapy)</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nIndividual wellness counseling</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nA vast array of massages and expert therapists</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nColon Hydrotherapy performed by a skillfully trained therapist</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nPersonal training and ARP WAVE treatments</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nMind-body work, Acupuncture, Unique fascial release &amp; PT work</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nRegression Therapy with NLP and EMDR</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nDe-stressing with Creative Visualizations</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nAddiction management with Brief Therapy Techniques</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nAccess to on-campus facilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"tel:561.471.5867\">\r\n\r\nCall now to book\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://issuu.com/hippocrateshealthinstitute/docs/organic_spa_and_salon_brochure_april_24_1_#block_brochure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n\r\nView brochure\r\n</a>\r\n<h2>Oasis Therapy Center</h2>\r\n1466 Hippocrates Way,\r\nWest Palm Beach, FL\r\n33411, USA\r\n<h2>561-471-5867</h2>\r\n<a href=\"tel:561.471.5867\">\r\n\r\nCall now\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/hoRbVVs1bgKtqRKMA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n\r\nGoogle Maps\r\n</a>\r\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/become-map.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n\r\nDownload Hippocrates map\r\n</a>\r\n<h1>Rebalance &amp; regenerate your mind, body, and spirit</h1>\r\nThe world-leading Oasis Therapy Center offers the full spectrum of cutting-edge treatments and therapies for the mind, body, and spirit, expertly designed to optimally boost, revitalize and nourish the whole body.\r\n\r\nOur goal is to cleanse and rebalance from the inside out by eliminating toxins, strengthening immunity, improving mental health with advanced mind-body therapies, and aiding sleep through our various lifestyle-enhancing treatments. Let our expert wellness therapists guide you on your journey of deep relaxation and healing through transformative bodywork and psychotherapy so you can reconnect to your highest wellbeing.\r\n\r\n<section><picture><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=330&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=495&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;m